      "$\\frac{du}{dx} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$.",
      "Let $v = \\sin^{-1}(2x\\sqrt{1-x^2}) = \\sin^{-1}(\\sin 2\\theta) = 2\\theta = 2\\sin^{-1} x$.",
      "$\\frac{dv}{dx} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$.",
      "$\\frac{du}{dv} = \\frac{1/\\sqrt{1-x^2}}{2/\\sqrt{1-x^2}} = 1/2$."
